{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi/pulls/1619","id":4064233344,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPBw_Hc7yP0eA","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi/pull/1619","diff_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi/pull/1619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi/pull/1619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-gaudi/issues/1619","number":1619,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Enable Gemma-4 models (E2B, 31B, 26B-A4B) on HPU","user":{"login":"jiminha","id":41488539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDg4NTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41488539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha","html_url":"https://github.com/jiminha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jiminha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\nEnable Gemma-4 model family on HPU with full GSM8K evaluation parity to GPU.\r\n\r\n- **Enable flatten_input for Gemma4** to fix E2B/E4B PLE on HPU\r\n- **Fix KV-sharing (YOCO) prefill attention** for Gemma-4's hybrid architecture (global full-attention + local sliding-window layers)\r\n- **Extend supported head sizes** from 256 to 576 to support Gemma-4's head_dim=512 global layers\r\n- **Add MoE gelu_tanh activation alias** — HPU's gelu TPC kernel uses tanh approximation, so map gelu_tanh to gelu\r\n- **Handle heterogeneous KV cache** for mixed attention types (different block sizes per layer)\r\n- **Add GSM8K CI tests** for all 3 models with add_bos_token support\r\n\r\n### Models Tested\r\n| Model | TP | GSM8K (limit=256) | Expected |\r\n|-------|----|--------------------|----------|\r\n| google/gemma-4-E2B-it | 1 | 0.535 | ≥0.55 |\r\n| google/gemma-4-31B-it | 2 | 0.926 | ≥0.92 |\r\n| google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it | 2 | 0.672 | ≥0.66 |\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T22:48:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T04:24:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T04:24:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-23T04:24:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"ae952098bd0485a29d2b675065b89ad3c5b75674","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"xuechendi","id":4355494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4355494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi","html_url":"https://github.com/xuechendi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuechendi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"PatrykWo","id":15016336,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDE2MzM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15016336?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrykWo","html_url":"https://github.com/PatrykWo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrykWo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrykWo/following{/other_user}","gist